  m_text: "You were once an engineer \u2014 brilliant, respected\u2026 until everything
    changed.\r\nFramed for sabotaging a top-secret government defense project, your
    name was erased, your freedom stripped.\r\n\r\nNow you\u2019re just another prisoner,
    chained and forgotten \u2014 bound for life\na fortress carved in stone and madness,
    home to the world\u2019s most violent Criminals.\r\nA place whispered about in
    fear \u2014 where no one ever returns.\r\n\r\n\n\n\n      Welcome to THE BLACKWATER
    ISLE\n"
